OL,3,GNEWSAPolice appeal to woman after
OL,4,AReform UK audience row
OL,5,
OL,6,FWest Midlands Police said: "We're aware
OL,7,Fof a video circulating from the Reform
OL,8,FUK Conference showing an incident with
OL,9,Fa protester. We haven't received a
OL,10,Fcomplaint but would ask the woman
OL,11,Finvolved to come forward and contact us
OL,12,Fso we can carry out enquiries."
